   title = "Hermes Branch Context — per-branch AI guidance + in-app Hermes launch"
   description = "Give every git worktree its own branch-specific Hermes context (.hermes.md that re-includes the global rules then adds domain expertise, e.g. InventoryAccounting = SQL-Ledger/Postgres <-> MySQL inventory integration; 3d = printing_3d consuming inventory/feeding accounting; DockerHA = K3s/HA; ai = v2 AI; BMaster = beekeeping). Add a 'Hermes' button to the Git dashboard that copies the branch's hermes chat -w launch command. Cover the one-install/no-per-branch-restart model and automate seeding for new branches."
   roles = "admin,developer,devops"
